abstract: "Frozen three-state routine-laboratory classifier, standalone zero-refit bedside scorer, external decision curve and ICU severity-score benchmarks, strict 48h/72h ICU-resident transition models, and aggregate verification tables across four critical care databases (N = 8,130)."
